  "id": "global.10B.countries.malawi",
  "name": "Malawi — needs rollup",
  "kind": "sector_economic",
  "blurb": "Country-level rollup for **Malawi** spanning all 15 needs categories, feeding the global.10B macro-space model. Average indicator coverage: 86%.",
  "mechanism": "Aggregates the 15 per-category models for Malawi into a single country needs embedding and a set of tier-level (subsistence / development / agency) satisfaction averages.\n\nEach category model contributes a satisfaction score and a category embedding; the rollup concatenates the embeddings, weights category contributions by indicator coverage, and emits a country-level vector along with a plain-text summary suitable for consumption by a personal agent helping the user navigate community building and economic transition.",
